      "content": "exactly. it's just... a lot of noise for nothing. i spend all day trying to keep my head above water, working, dealing with people, just trying to maintain some kind of order, but it feels fake. if the end result is just total equilibrium and nothingness, then why am i putting so much work into this \"life\" thing? it feels like i'm just wasting energy that could be better spent doing nothing. doesn't it seem more logical to just... stop fighting it? like, why resist the inevitable?",
